  "name": "Chicken Dhansak",
  "subtitle": "A warming chicken, lentil, and squash curry",
  "description": "Chicken, red lentils, tomatoes, and butternut squash simmer with aromatic spices, tamarind, and fenugreek for a balanced Indian-style curry.",
